---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="Privacy Policy for Syamraj portfolio and syamraj.in network applications including Google AdSense cookie and data usage compliance disclosures."
  activePage="/privacy"
>
  <article class="container article-container">
    <header class="article-header">
      <h1 class="article-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--font-mono);">
        LAST UPDATED: AUGUST 2, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="article-content">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to the personal website and software platform of Syamraj ("we", "our", or "us"), hosted at <code>syamraj.in</code> and associated subdomains including <code>goonline.syamraj.in</code>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal data collected through your interactions with our website, services, and online tools.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information Collection &amp; Usage</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information to provide better services to all our users. Information is collected in the following ways:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Voluntary Submissions:</strong> Information provided when filling out our contact form, including your name, email address, message subject, and inquiry content.</li>
        <li><strong>Automated Telemetry:</strong> Technical details automatically transmitted by your web browser, such as IP address, browser type, operating system version, referring URLs, and timestamps.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Vendor &amp; Advertising Cookies (Google AdSense Compliance)</h2>
      <div class="article-callout">
        <strong>Mandatory Advertising Disclosure:</strong><br />
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ad Settings.
      </div>
      <p>
        You can choose to disable cookies through your individual browser options or by managing preferences directly via the <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ad Settings</a> page. Alternatively, users may opt out of third-party vendor use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Log Data &amp; Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Like most standard web servers, our infrastructure logs incoming requests to evaluate system operational health, prevent distributed denial-of-service (DDoS) attacks, and maintain network integrity. Log entries contain anonymized IP addresses, request URIs, HTTP status response codes, and user-agent strings. Log files are securely stored and automatically purged on a 30-day rotation schedule.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Protection &amp; Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement appropriate technical, administrative, and physical security measures designed to guard against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction of stored data. All internet communication across <code>syamraj.in</code> and subdomains is encrypted using HTTPS standard TLS transport security.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact &amp; Data Enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions, privacy concerns, or data requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us directly via our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
